&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;{ following_qualifications_would_be_in_line_with_our_desired_profile_for_this_position: [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a college degree in a STEM field or comparable training with relevant professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have extensive experience in the software development process with a focus on software quality assurance and will take responsibility for test strategy, test design, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, you hold an ISTQB certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate confidently with various stakeholders and can explain technical concepts clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in full-stack test automation using Serenity or Playwright.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You confidently apply your programming skills in TypeScript or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, you have experience coordinating other QA engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work in a structured, solution-oriented manner and actively contribute to the team’s continued development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident communication in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;German and English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally at &lt;strong&gt;B2 level or above&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
